Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},It had rained in Sol for\Nnine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.33,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},One man never got wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},They called him Aura\NMonster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Midnight. No umbrella.\NBone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:12.33,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The shopkeepers said luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:13.89,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The police said a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The kids said magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So one night, I followed\Nhim into the alleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.65,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He wasn't stopping the\Nrain. He was dodging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:27.09,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Every drop. Too fast for\Nthe storm to touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:29.08,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},"You'll catch a cold,\Nkid."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},"Teach me," I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:35.54,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So he did. Every night, in\Nthe rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},I held my umbrella. I\Ncouldn't dodge yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},A hundred nights. A\Nthousand drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:43.82,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then one night, I closed\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Now there are two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:47.56,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},And we never get wet.
